WEBVTT

asr-000037
00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:29.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: We take up the proposed budget of the presidential communications office and its attached agencies and corporations for fiscal year 2027. The PCO occupies a unique position in government. It is responsible not only for communicating the policies, [unclear] and activities of the

asr-000038
00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:59.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: president and the national government but also for ensuring that accurate and timely public information reaches our people and today that responsibility becomes even more important. We live in a time when information travels within seconds. Social media has changed how Filipinos receive their news. Artificial intelligence or AI has made it easier to create fake images, videos and even statements. Misinformation and disinformation can

asr-000039
00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:29.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: spread faster than government can respond. Kayo po ang nasa frontline. Kayo po ang inyong ahensya po ang ikanga ang haharap sa problema na ito. Nais po nating malaman mamaya kung ano po ang pwedeng gawin ng inyong tanggap Ginoong Kalihim upang labanan po itong fake news po na ito. Hindi po sapat na mabilis ang impormasyon. Dapat tama, malinaw at

asr-000040
00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:59.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: mapagkakatiwalaan. And government communication must always serve the public interest. Public fund should be used to inform the Filipino people not for partisan political purposes. For fiscal year 2027 the PCO and its attached agencies and corporations are proposing approximately 2.526 billion in new appropriations lower than their 2026 budget.

asr-000041
00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:29.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Today we will look at the [unclear] of existing funds. We will ask whether the mandates of our different government communications offices remain clearly defined or whether there are functions that overlap and can be streamlined. And more importantly, we want to know whether government information is actually reaching our people or dumarating lang [unclear] yung mga fake news ng kung sino-sino. We need you guys especially these days.

asr-000042
00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:59.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: We don't need fake news coming from [unclear] polluted sources. And more importantly, we want to know whether government information is actually reaching our people. Umaabot ba ang impormasyon ng gobyerno sa mga probinsya? Nauna ba ito kaysa sa mga fake news? Ano po ang ginagawa ng ating ahensya? Ano po ang ginagawa ng ating TV stations, radio stations ng Philippine

asr-000043
00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:29.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Information Agency, Philippine News Agency? Ano po ang ginagawa para masawata, mapigilan po itong mga fake news po na ito? And beyond We must also about public trust government communication can simply be measured by the number of press releases issued post uploaded or engagement generated the more important question is do Filipino people trust the

asr-000044
00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:59.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: information coming from their government or they trust more the fake news that they read over social media as we examine this budget therefore our purpose Straight forward we want a government communication system that is efficient in its spending, effective in its reach, responsible in its messaging, and credible to the Filipino people. With that we welcome the officials and representatives of the presidential

asr-000045
00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:29.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: communications office and its attached agencies and corporations the [unclear] of Broadcast services, Bureau of Communication Services, National Printing Office, News and Information Bureau, Philippine Information Agency, Presidential Broadcast Service, Intercontinental Broadcasting Corporation and People's Television Network. Maraming salamat po and we may now proceed with the presentation of the proposed 2027 budget.

