Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi naman natin maiwasan using itong bagong teknolohiya ngayon.

asr-002375
02:06:35.240 --> 02:06:40.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ngunit, please continue fighting fake news.

asr-002376
02:06:40.880 --> 02:06:44.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And i-promote din po natin yung tamang informasyon.

asr-002377
