Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. Chair, the PCO sa NEP for fiscal year 2027 is 2.526 billion,

asr-002388
02:07:33.180 --> 02:07:43.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: which is 188.48 million lower than its NGA of 2.715 billion,

asr-002389
02:07:43.740 --> 02:07:48.180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: inclusive of the appropriations for its attached corporations.

asr-002390
