Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung sa PSC po, sa sports, napakaliit rin po.

asr-002396
02:08:15.500 --> 02:08:18.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mas maliit yung kanilang approved budget.

asr-002397
