asr-002401
02:08:35.820 --> 02:08:40.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: katulad ngayon sa Asian Games, ay hindi po matutumbasan yung karangalang na ibibigay

asr-002402
02:08:40.380 --> 02:08:43.180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ng ating mga national athletes through PSC.

asr-002403
02:08:43.180 --> 02:08:47.260
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana po, since kayo naman po malapit sa Malacanang,

asr-002404
02:08:48.200 --> 02:08:49.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sana.

asr-002405
02:08:49.760 --> 02:08:54.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa mga future budget deliberations, before submitting the budget here,

asr-002406
02:08:54.980 --> 02:09:02.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sana ipaglaban nyo na po na magkaroon kayo ng bigger share of the pie.

asr-002407
02:09:03.800 --> 02:09:06.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ipaglaban nyo po sa DBM.

asr-002408
02:09:07.220 --> 02:09:09.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kayo naman, magkakalapit lang opisina nyo sa Malacanang.

asr-002409
02:09:09.860 --> 02:09:12.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Isang lakad lang yan.

asr-002410
02:09:13.280 --> 02:09:19.100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Para mas malawak ang inyong paggagamitan.

asr-002411
02:09:19.760 --> 02:09:23.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang pondo at makapagservisyo kayo ng maayos sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-002412
02:09:23.540 --> 02:09:24.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Naintindihan ko po ang inyong trabaho.

asr-002413
02:09:25.300 --> 02:09:29.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nandito po ako para sumuporta po sa inyong budget.

asr-002414
02:09:29.800 --> 02:09:33.880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Bagamat isang boto lamang po ako, sumusuporta naman po ako rito.

asr-002415
02:09:34.020 --> 02:09:36.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Basta magamit lang po yung pondo sa tama.

asr-002416
02:09:36.920 --> 02:09:45.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And continue fighting fake news and promote yung tamang informasyon sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-002417
02:09:46.200 --> 02:09:47.260
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pero balikan ko lang po.

asr-002418
02:09:47.840 --> 02:09:48.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Isa lang po ang aking...

asr-002419
02:09:49.760 --> 02:09:50.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ...concern dito.

asr-002420
02:09:51.840 --> 02:09:55.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Agree po ako sa inyong budget.

asr-002421
02:09:55.520 --> 02:09:56.820
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Suportado po natin yan.

asr-002422
02:09:59.580 --> 02:10:01.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pero sana po...

asr-002423
02:10:01.840 --> 02:10:09.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I welcome the pronouncement earlier that APO is not seeking a passport fee increase from the public.

asr-002424
02:10:09.140 --> 02:10:15.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: But is requesting government subsidy potentially through the DFA to cover rising production costs.

asr-002425
02:10:16.840 --> 02:10:19.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana po idaan natin lang ito sa...

asr-002426
02:10:19.140 --> 02:10:20.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ...through government subsidy.

asr-002427
02:10:21.540 --> 02:10:25.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yun din po ang panawagan ko sa simula pa pumutok yung isyong ito.

asr-002428
02:10:25.880 --> 02:10:28.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Talagang kontra po ako sa pagtaas.

asr-002429
02:10:30.760 --> 02:10:33.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Agree po ako sa inyong lahat sa budget ninyo.

asr-002430
02:10:33.780 --> 02:10:37.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kontra po ako sa pagtaas ng passport fee.

asr-002431
02:10:38.260 --> 02:10:40.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Malaking pahira po yun sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-002432
02:10:41.960 --> 02:10:47.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nakakausap po yung mga OFWs natin nung pumunta po ako sa Asian Games.

asr-002433
02:10:49.140 --> 02:10:54.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Alam nyo, bawat piso, bawat sentimo po ay napakahalaga po para sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-002434
02:10:55.240 --> 02:10:56.960
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lalong-lalo na po sa mga may hirap.

asr-002435
02:10:57.320 --> 02:11:00.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung mga mayayaman, baliwala sa kanila yung increase.

asr-002436
02:11:00.680 --> 02:11:02.360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pero sa mga may hirap nating kababayan,

asr-002437
02:11:02.980 --> 02:11:06.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: bawat piso, bawat sentimo ay napakahalaga po sa kanila.

asr-002438
02:11:06.920 --> 02:11:16.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya for the record, tutol po ako sa pagtaas ng passport processing fee.

asr-002439
02:11:16.320 --> 02:11:18.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Huwag nyo po sanang itaas, sir.

asr-002440
02:11:19.140 --> 02:11:21.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nakamakaawa po ako. Nakakiusap po ako sa inyo.

asr-002441
02:11:22.680 --> 02:11:26.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nasagot nyo naman po siguro kanina na lugi po kayo.

asr-002442
02:11:26.940 --> 02:11:28.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Magpalugi na lang kayo, sir.

asr-002443
02:11:29.580 --> 02:11:34.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kesa itaas nyo yung presyo ng passport.

asr-002444
02:11:35.320 --> 02:11:39.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Malaking pabigat po ito sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-002445
02:11:40.060 --> 02:11:45.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kung maari, gawan nyo po ng paraan na huwag naman po sana.

asr-002446
02:11:45.780 --> 02:11:48.820
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kahit 9.50 nga ngayon, nabibigatan na po sila.

asr-002447
02:11:49.140 --> 02:11:51.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nakikita nyo yung pumipila.

asr-002448
02:11:52.400 --> 02:11:56.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana wala na pong pila sa pag-apply ng passport ngayon.

asr-002449
02:11:56.600 --> 02:11:57.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mas naging mabilis.

asr-002450
02:11:57.680 --> 02:12:00.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dati makikita mo, madaling araw pa lang pumipila na.

asr-002451
02:12:00.700 --> 02:12:05.060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At noon, may mga shortage ng printing ng passport ngayon.

asr-002452
02:12:05.160 --> 02:12:05.560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Wala na po?

asr-002453
02:12:06.380 --> 02:12:08.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So tuloy-tuloy po ang inyong...

asr-002454
02:12:09.140 --> 02:12:11.080
APO Production Unit President Atty. Gil Carlos R. Puyat IV: Yes, sir. Tuloy-tuloy po yung printing.

asr-002455
02:12:11.200 --> 02:12:12.380
APO Production Unit President Atty. Gil Carlos R. Puyat IV: Wala na pong shortage ngayon.

asr-002456
02:12:13.480 --> 02:12:15.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So wala nang shortage kahit saan.

asr-002457
02:12:15.920 --> 02:12:18.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dito sa Manila and even in the provinces po.

asr-002458
02:12:19.140 --> 02:12:22.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So tuloy-tuloy po inyong pag-printa.

asr-002459
02:12:22.800 --> 02:12:23.300
APO Production Unit President Atty. Gil Carlos R. Puyat IV: Yes, your honor.

asr-002460
02:12:23.480 --> 02:12:27.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So can we get your commitment po na huwag muna kayo magtaas, sir?

asr-002461
02:12:27.740 --> 02:12:29.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yun talagang hinain ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-002462
02:12:30.880 --> 02:12:34.560
APO Production Unit President Atty. Gil Carlos R. Puyat IV: Sir, kaya sumulat po kami sa DFA para humingi ng subsidy.

asr-002463
02:12:35.060 --> 02:12:38.420
APO Production Unit President Atty. Gil Carlos R. Puyat IV: At hindi po namin ipapasa sa public yung pagtataas.

asr-002464
02:12:39.340 --> 02:12:46.360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kasi kung magtataas kayo ng passport processing fee,

asr-002465
02:12:46.820 --> 02:12:49.100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. Chair, mag-object talaga.

asr-002466
02:12:49.140 --> 02:12:53.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa floor, kahit mag-isa lang ako, yun talagang i-object ko po, Mr. Chair.

asr-002467
02:12:53.800 --> 02:12:54.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Please lang po.

asr-002468
02:12:54.340 --> 02:12:59.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Actually, for the indulgence of my colleague, Sen. Ergo,

asr-002469
02:13:00.460 --> 02:13:02.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: hindi naman daw nila tataasan, there was an assurance,

asr-002470
02:13:03.120 --> 02:13:07.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kundi they would better ask for a subsidy from the government

asr-002471
02:13:07.100 --> 02:13:13.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: through the Department of Foreign Affairs, Sen. Bong.

asr-002472
02:13:13.480 --> 02:13:18.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana po yung magawaan po ito ng paraan na huwag po ipasa

asr-002473
02:13:18.900 --> 02:13:22.560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sa ating mga kababayan, yung pabigat po yun sa kanila,

asr-002474
02:13:22.680 --> 02:13:24.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: yung pagtataas po ng passport processing fee.

asr-002475
02:13:25.100 --> 02:13:26.740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Please lang, sir, huwag niyo pong taasan.

asr-002476
02:13:26.920 --> 02:13:27.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat po.

asr-002477
02:13:28.380 --> 02:13:35.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ako po'y sumusuporta po sa ating Presidential Communications Office

asr-002478
02:13:35.400 --> 02:13:37.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: at sa lahat po ng attached agencies.

asr-002479
02:13:37.960 --> 02:13:41.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At bago yan, gusto ko lang po magpasalamat sa inyong lahat,

asr-002480
02:13:41.460 --> 02:13:44.120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sa inyong servisyo sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-002481
02:13:44.880 --> 02:13:47.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang pakiusap ko lang po sa inyo, unahin ninyo po yung kapakanan

asr-002482
02:13:48.900 --> 02:13:52.360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ng ating mga ordinaryong mamamayang Pilipino.

asr-002483
02:13:53.360 --> 02:13:54.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yun po, unahin natin.

asr-002484
02:13:55.760 --> 02:13:59.100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Just be, ano, ang pakiusap ko rin po sa inyo, just be fair.

asr-002485
02:13:59.560 --> 02:14:04.200
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Unahin natin ang interest ng bawat Pilipino.

asr-002486
02:14:04.440 --> 02:14:06.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Unahin po natin ang interest ng bayan.

asr-002487
02:14:06.480 --> 02:14:09.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat po and congratulations po sa inyong lahat.

asr-002488
02:14:09.740 --> 02:14:11.780
Secretary David M. Gomez: Maraming salamat, Your Honor, on behalf of the PCO.

asr-002489
02:14:11.880 --> 02:14:12.840
Secretary David M. Gomez: Makakaasa po kayo.

asr-002490
02:14:13.140 --> 02:14:16.540
Secretary David M. Gomez: And if I may echo lang po yung sinabi ng Presidente natin ng APO,

asr-002491
02:14:16.980 --> 02:14:18.880
Secretary David M. Gomez: you have my personal assurance po,

asr-002492
02:14:18.900 --> 02:14:24.060
Secretary David M. Gomez: na hindi po namin tataasan yung presyo at ipapass on sa ating mga mamamayan

asr-002493
02:14:24.060 --> 02:14:27.200
Secretary David M. Gomez: yung additional cost to print the passports po.

asr-002494
02:14:27.580 --> 02:14:29.320
Secretary David M. Gomez: So, you have my personal assurance, Your Honor.

asr-002495
02:14:29.460 --> 02:14:30.180
Secretary David M. Gomez: Thank you very much po.

asr-002496
02:14:30.440 --> 02:14:32.520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat po, Secretary Dave Gomez.

asr-002497
02:14:32.960 --> 02:14:33.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. Chair, salamat.

asr-002498
02:14:36.720 --> 02:14:39.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Senator Bong, for coming, for joining us.

asr-002499
02:14:40.000 --> 02:14:42.460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Thank you even just for a brief moment.

asr-002500
02:14:42.580 --> 02:14:46.080
Senator Erwin Tulfo: But anyway, there being no more questions,

asr-002501
02:14:46.080 --> 02:14:51.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: the Fiscal Year 2027 Proposed Budget of the Presidential Communications Office

asr-002502
02:14:51.140 --> 02:14:56.420
Senator Erwin Tulfo: and its attached agencies and corporations is deemed submitted for plenary consideration.

asr-002503
02:14:56.980 --> 02:14:57.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Thank you very much.

asr-002504
02:14:58.400 --> 02:14:59.800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: And I would like to thank the officials and...

asr-002505
02:14:59.800 --> 02:15:02.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: employees of PCO for their budget briefing

asr-002506
02:15:02.100 --> 02:15:03.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: to the committee.

asr-002507
02:15:04.300 --> 02:15:05.920
Senator Erwin Tulfo: This budget briefing is hereby

asr-002508
02:15:05.920 --> 02:15:08.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: suspended. Maraming salamat po.

